# The source paintings the cards are built from, one folder per style under
# art/. Kept locally for reference the way Anthem keeps its MIDI, but not
# committed: they are 2–4 MB each against the 14–30 KB they become, so the
# repository would grow by megabytes per dinosaur for files nobody ever
# loads. Each folder's README records where every one came from and under
# which licence, which is enough to fetch them again exactly.
/art/*/*.png
/art/*/*.jpg
/art/*/*.jpeg
/art/*/*.webp
